{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00101",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.91,
      "end_seconds": 6.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "Doctor, hello, I've got my papers here, where should I put them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.47,
      "end_seconds": 12.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Alright, of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.38,
      "end_seconds": 17.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Um, so... burning in both feet. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.31,
      "end_seconds": 20.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.65,
      "end_seconds": 24.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "It's been two months, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.33,
      "end_seconds": 29.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "I see. Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.94,
      "end_seconds": 36.61,
      "duration_seconds": 6.67,
      "text": "It's moderate, honestly. Bedsheets touching them definitely sets it off. I'd say on and off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.06,
      "end_seconds": 39.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Have you had any fever or hand symptoms?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.96,
      "end_seconds": 41.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "No, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.67,
      "end_seconds": 44.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.36,
      "end_seconds": 47.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.08,
      "end_seconds": 60.66,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. So, what about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.95,
      "end_seconds": 63.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.83,
      "end_seconds": 68.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.09,
      "end_seconds": 69.88,
      "duration_seconds": 0.79,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.64,
      "end_seconds": 90.94,
      "duration_seconds": 6.3,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Are you on any tablets or medication? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.71,
      "end_seconds": 98.64,
      "duration_seconds": 6.93,
      "text": "I take paracetamol, 500 milligrams, when needed. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.4,
      "end_seconds": 107.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.45,
      "end_seconds": 120.39,
      "duration_seconds": 11.94,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.97,
      "end_seconds": 125.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.85,
      "end_seconds": 128.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.25,
      "end_seconds": 133.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "So, do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.61,
      "end_seconds": 143.8,
      "duration_seconds": 10.19,
      "text": "Not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.14,
      "end_seconds": 146.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.65,
      "end_seconds": 153.0,
      "duration_seconds": 6.35,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.9,
      "end_seconds": 157.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.45,
      "end_seconds": 159.29,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "Yes, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.22,
      "end_seconds": 163.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Stay still while I have a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.1,
      "end_seconds": 184.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Feeling of light touch is reduced in both feet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.71,
      "end_seconds": 186.41,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.06,
      "end_seconds": 206.98,
      "duration_seconds": 14.92,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. So, based on the history and the examination, my working impression is peripheral neuropathy, possibly related to sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.39,
      "end_seconds": 211.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.81,
      "end_seconds": 229.69,
      "duration_seconds": 16.88,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's peripheral neuropathy, possibly related to sugar, and we'll know more once the a vitamin B12 level is back. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had burning in both feet for two months, moderate, and no hand symptoms or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.67,
      "end_seconds": 231.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.6,
      "end_seconds": 249.95,
      "duration_seconds": 14.35,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.11,
      "end_seconds": 252.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "That's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.83,
      "end_seconds": 279.03,
      "duration_seconds": 25.2,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a vitamin B12 level for neuropathy. Let's use pregabalin, 75 milligrams, at night, for four weeks. It's for nerve pain. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well. Check your feet every evening for cuts or blisters, you may not feel them. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.19,
      "end_seconds": 286.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.78,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.48,
      "end_seconds": 289.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.47,
      "end_seconds": 301.05,
      "duration_seconds": 8.58,
      "text": "Come back after the results are back. Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me so I know I haven't been confusing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.26,
      "end_seconds": 311.66,
      "duration_seconds": 9.4,
      "text": "So, I take the pregabalin, 75 milligrams, at night and come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.76,
      "end_seconds": 316.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, we're done for today. Take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 319.53,
      "end_seconds": 322.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "That's everything I wanted to ask. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.27,
      "end_seconds": 325.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Bye for now, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}